  "strings": [
    "A small, brave army stands at last within the jaws of Sauron's trap.\u0000",
    "But the courage of men will not fail and their hope will not fade.\u0000",
    "For they hold that their sacrifice at the Black Gate of Mordor\u0000",
    "shall gain time for Frodo to at last destroy the One Ring.\u0000",
    "And in this final hour...\u0000",
    "the Captains of the West must continue to fight for their freedom\u0000",
    "while their breath still remains.\u0000"
